# Steel path modules, actions and items of the ninja suit.

ninja-module-steel-shuriken = Shuriken
ninja-module-steel-shuriken-desc = An emitter of energy shurikens. They pass through glass, hit stamina and leave burns.

ninja-module-steel-adrenaline = Adrenaline
ninja-module-steel-adrenaline-desc = The suit injects a dose of Velaxin: the body speeds up, stuns and drowsiness are removed. Side effect: radiation. Charges are refilled with 10 sheets of uranium.

ninja-module-steel-emp = EM Burst
ninja-module-steel-emp-desc = A fairly large electromagnetic charge around the suit. The ninja is unharmed, but the pulse disables nearby technology.

ninja-module-steel-net = Energy Net
ninja-module-steel-net-desc = A net emitter that pins the target in place. The net is fairly sturdy, but can still be broken with an improvised weapon.

ent-ActionNinjaShuriken = Shuriken
    .desc = Summons or retracts the energy shuriken emitter.
ent-ActionNinjaAdrenal = Adrenaline surge
    .desc = Injects Velaxin into the bloodstream: speed, removal of stuns and drowsiness. A bit of radiation. Recharges with 10 sheets of uranium.
ent-ActionNinjaEmp = EM Burst
    .desc = Emits an electromagnetic pulse around the suit, disabling nearby technology.
ent-ActionNinjaNet = Energy Net
    .desc = Summons or retracts the energy net emitter.

ent-WeaponNinjaShuriken = energy shuriken emitter
    .desc = Fires bursts of energy shurikens powered by the suit battery. Works through glass.
ent-ShurikenProjectile = shuriken
    .desc = An energy shuriken.
ent-WeaponNinjaNet = energy net emitter
    .desc = Launches an energy net that keeps the target from running away.
ent-NinjaNet = energy net
    .desc = A net of solid energy. It can be broken, but not taken off.

ninja-adrenal-injected = The suit injects a reagent. Your heart starts beating faster.
ninja-energy-net-recharging = The net emitter is still recharging!

reagent-name-velaxin = velaxin
reagent-desc-velaxin = A combat stimulant designed for true samurai. Speeds the body up and removes stuns and drowsiness, but irradiates the body.
